 \item \textbf{Unflagged Textual Refusals:}
 System-level flagging (\texttt{safety\_rejected = True}) undercounts epistemic refusals. Adding textual refusals (asserting contextual absence without gate triggering) raises counts to \TerraEpistemicRefusals/350 for TERRA, \FlatEpistemicRefusals/350 for Flat Vector RAG, \GraphEpistemicRefusals/350 for GraphRAG-Adapted, and \HippoEpistemicRefusals/350 for HippoRAG-Adapted. Unflagged TERRA cases are D034 (refusal phrasing with fatal error, score 0.000), D061 (verified refutation, floored at \AmendmentMFloorScore\ under Amendment~M), and D068/D070 (fast-path textual refusals scoring 1.000). Aggregate Table~\ref{tab:sensitivity_raw_vs_clamped} sensitivity results for TERRA are invariant to this distinction ($\Delta = 0.000$).
 
